1
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:17,250
"She who controls death... cannot know the experience of dying"

2
00:00:28,025 --> 00:00:29,025
So...

3
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:33,150
This is what death feels like

4
00:00:37,425 --> 00:00:38,250
Humans

5
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:39,675
Gods

6
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,950
Even ██████...

7
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,625
I need not despise you any longer

8
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:52,475
Respond to the mother of all forbidden creations...

9
00:00:54,335 --> 00:01:00,450
Hidden by Hyperborea in the depths of the Shadow Realm: the "Eitr"...

10
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:23,275
Take this feeling with the hallowing of soil

11
00:01:24,550 --> 00:01:26,600
And give them to the world...

12
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:31,350
...This is my parting gift

